      "explanation": "First evaluate the left side:\n\\[\n\\frac{2+3+4}{3}=\\frac93=3.\n\\]\nThe right numerator is \\(1990+1991+1992=5973\\). Dividing \\(5973\\) by \\(N\\) must therefore give \\(3\\), which means that \\(3\\) times \\(N\\) is \\(5973\\). Thus\n\\[\nN=5973\\div3=1991.\n\\]\nThis denominator is nonzero, and \\(5973/1991=3\\), as required. Therefore \\(\\boxed{N=1991}\\), choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{D}}\\).",
